[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3093\u306B\u3061\u306F\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hi there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\uFF01\u3000\u3053\u306E\u9593\u306F\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u306D\n\u4F9D\u983C\u4EBA\u3055\u3093\u3001\u5927\u559C\u3073\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Thanks for your help the other day.\nThe client was absolutely thrilled!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\uFF01\u3000\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u7532\u6590\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u306D\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u3082\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s wonderful! All that hard work paid off!\nIt\u0027s all thanks to you, Senio\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u30FC\u3063\u3068\u3002\u300C\u5148\u8F29\u300D\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\uFF5E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa there. What happened to dropping the \u0022Senior\u0022~?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u2026\u2026\u3055\u3093\u306E\u304A\u304B\u3052\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-Ryza... um, thanks to you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u3057\u3088\u3057\u3001\u305D\u306E\u8ABF\u5B50\uFF01\n\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3001\u4ECA\u65E5\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s more like it!\nSo, what brings you here today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3002\u3042\u306E\u65E5\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, about the other day..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u306A\u306B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm? What is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3001\u304A\u624B\u3092\u62DD\u501F\u3057\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "P-Please, let me borrow your hand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u79D8\u5BC6\u306E\u8A71\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? Is this some kind of secret?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3048\u3001\u305D\u3046\u3067\u306F\u306A\u304F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that\u0027s not it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u65E5\u306F\u3001\u76F8\u8AC7\u306B\u4E57\u3063\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u308A\n\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you for listening to my concerns\nthe other day"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u8F29\u306A\u3093\u3066\u547C\u3070\u308C\u3066\u3001\u821E\u3044\u4E0A\u304C\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I got so excited when you called me \u0022Senior\u0022"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u307E\u3060\u307E\u3060\u5F8C\u8F29\u3067\u3044\u305F\u3044\n\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3082\u3042\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But part of me still wants to be\nyour junior"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3068\u304D\u3001\u304A\u5E2B\u5320\u69D8\u3068\u306E\u304A\u8A71\u3092\n\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3044\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And then, when you told me about\nyour master..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u3060\u3051\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u304C\u8EFD\u304F\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3001\n\u69CB\u3048\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3048\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I felt a little lighter somehow, like I didn\u0027t\nhave to be so formal about everything"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u7DCA\u5F35\u3055\u305B\u308B\u3053\u3068\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Sorry if I made you feel pressured"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3068\u3093\u3067\u3082\u306A\u3044\uFF01\n\u3080\u3057\u308D\u3001\u8003\u3048\u308B\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, not at all!\nIf anything, it gave me something to think about"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u304C\u8AB0\u304B\u306E\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u306A\u308C\u305F\u3068\u304D\u3082\u3001\n\u843D\u3061\u7740\u3044\u3066\u3001\u53D7\u3051\u6B62\u3081\u3066\u3042\u3052\u305F\u3044\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When I become someone\u0027s senior one day,\nI want to be calm and supportive"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306F\u307E\u3060\u3001\u305D\u308F\u305D\u308F\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3051\u3069\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though for now, I still get all nervous"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3063\u3002\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. That\u0027s understandable"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3001\u3082\u3057\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u3055\u3093\u3055\u3048\n\u3088\u308D\u3057\u3051\u308C\u3070\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, if it\u0027s alright with you,\nRyza..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Can I really have this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u3055\u3093\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u8ABF\u5408\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\n\u3042\u306E\u9B5A\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u3082\u5408\u3046\u3001\u7279\u88FD\u9999\u8F9B\u6599\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I synthesized it just for you!\nIt\u0027s a special spice that goes perfectly with that fish!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3001\u3053\u308C\u304C\u3001\u4F8B\u306E\uFF01\n\u3046\u308F\u3042\uFF01\u3000\u98DF\u6B32\u3092\u305D\u305D\u308B\u3044\u3044\u9999\u308A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-Is this the one you mentioned?!\nWow! What an appetizing aroma!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u308C\u306F\u306B\u3093\u306B\u304F\u3068\u5510\u8F9B\u5B50\u3060\u306A\uFF5E\u3002\n\u9055\u3046\u3002\u307B\u306E\u304B\u306B\u9999\u308B\u3001\u723D\u3084\u304B\u306A\u98A8\u5473\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can smell garlic and chili pepper...\nNo, wait. That refreshing note is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\uFF5E\u3001\u751F\u306E\u80E1\u6912\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm~ fresh peppercorns?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B8B\u5FF5\uFF01\u3000\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3055\u3059\u304C\u306F\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01\n\u305D\u306E\u767A\u60F3\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wrong! But as expected of Senior Ryza!\nI hadn\u0027t even thought of that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3001\u308F\u3042\uFF01\u3000\u3073\u3063\u304F\u308A\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-Whoa! You startled me..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3048\u3068\u3001\u6B63\u89E3\u306F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, so what\u0027s the right answer?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5B9F\u306F\u3053\u306E\u9999\u8F9B\u6599\u3001\u30D5\u30EA\u30FC\u30B2\u30F3\u306E\u8FD1\u304F\u3067\n\u63A1\u308C\u308B\u3082\u306E\u3060\u3051\u3067\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, this spice blend only uses ingredients\nfound near Freegen"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4EF0\u308B\u3068\u304A\u308A\u3001\u723D\u3084\u304B\u3067\u3074\u308A\u308A\u3068\u8F9B\u3044\n\u6728\u306E\u5B9F\u304C\u5B58\u5728\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just as you said, there are berries here that have\na refreshing yet spicy flavor"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u5B9F\u306B\u306F\u72EC\u7279\u306E\u6210\u5206\u304C\u542B\u307E\u308C\u3066\u304A\u308A\u3001\n\u5473\u899A\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306A\u304F\u8133\u3092\u3082\u523A\u6FC0\u3057\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They contain unique compounds that stimulate\nnot just your taste buds, but your brain too"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u305F\u3081\u3001\u5869\u5206\u5C11\u306A\u3081\u3067\u3082\u3088\u308A\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u304F\u3001\n\u98A8\u5473\u8C4A\u304B\u306B\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So even with less salt, it brings out\nmore flavor and richness!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3001\u305D\u3046\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3002\u3059\u3054\u3044\u306D\u30FC\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I see. That\u0027s amazing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u306E\u4EF0\u308B\u6848\u3082\n\u307E\u305F\u8A66\u3057\u3066\u307F\u305F\u3044\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I\u0027d love to try your suggestion too,\nSenior Ryza!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304D\u3063\u3068\u9055\u3046\u7F8E\u5473\u3057\u3055\u3092\u5F15\u304D\u51FA\u305B\u308B\u306F\u305A\uFF01",
